Package: secubox-eye-remote
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 dnsmasq-base,
 secubox-core,
 python3-fastapi,
 python3-uvicorn,
 udev
Description: SecuBox Eye Remote USB Gadget Integration
 Host-side integration for SecuBox Eye Remote (Pi Zero W with
 HyperPixel 2.1 Round Touch display).
 .
 Features:
  - Auto-detection via udev when Eye Remote is connected
  - Network configuration (10.55.0.1/30)
  - FastAPI endpoint for metrics relay
  - WebUI control panel integration
  - Serial console passthrough
 .
 The Eye Remote provides:
  - Real-time dashboard display (480x480 circular)
  - USB gadget modes: OTG, Flash, Debug, TTY, Auth
  - Touch-based menu navigation
  - Serial console access to SecuBox
